description:
Design a one-hot state machine with four states and two output signals. This module takes a four-bit input and transitions between states based on the currently active input while maintaining a single active state at a time (one-hot encoding). The outputs indicate the specific states: out[0] is high when in state 1, and out[1] is high when in state 2. The state transitions occur on the positive edge of a clock signal, ensuring synchronous operation.
